    exists( $uitkomst_26 : Outcome( stack == "defaults A:Wrakrecht.uitkering" && chain >= 0 && chain < 2 && kind == dev.uchar.regelspraak.transpiler.tms.Outcome.Kind.DECIDED, subject != null, subject == $onderwerp, beta2_defaultsAWrakrechtUitkeringVerschilWortel(this, $besluit) ) )
